386→                        <div id="content">For what values of $0\leq m&lt;n$ is there a complete sequence $A=\{a_1\leq a_2\leq \cdots\}$ of integers such that<ul>
387→<li> $A$ remains complete after removing any $m$ elements, but </li>
388→<li> $A$ is not complete after removing any $n$ elements? </li>
389→</ul></div>
